  "description": "Teamfight Manager 2 base 0.5.8 / stable ABI 8 repair test build. Xayah and Yone encyclopedia cards use the game's own champion-icon resolver at the finished-hero 2.0 scale, with a shared full-body foot line ten pixels above the native level selector. Yone now uses a reference-grounded, finished-hero-calibrated upright gait: moderate passing/contact steps, stable body height, restrained torso motion, alternating hands and both swords, without the exaggerated crossover deformation from 0.12.9. Fate Sealed keeps its staged wind-up, launch, knock-up, dual-slash and pull/echo presentation aligned to the real rush tick. His pure-data Q/W/R kit has no active E; retired native names remain no-op saved-season compatibility shims. Shen stays on the repaired original Q/W/R contract. All nine data_champion definitions, BP chrome and illustrations, Rift map/towers/Nexus, HUD art, announcer audio and BP/match music remain active. A fresh test save is required to embed the current Yone action tree.",
